 "pdf": "ads1263.pdf",
 "pages": "p.4-5 (pins), p.6 (ROC), p.10-11 (timing), p.61-63 (conversion control, Table 9-13 latency), p.67-72 (data read, status byte, codes, checksum), p.85-87 (commands), p.88-106 (registers)",
 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, PGA, internal reference, IDACs, TDACs, sensor bias, VBIAS, level shift, monitors and alarms (STAT alarm and EXTCLK bits are never set), chop and IDAC rotation, offset/full-scale calibration math (OFCAL/FSCAL stored only)",
  "ADC2 (24-bit auxiliary ADC): START2/STOP2 are nops, no ADC2 conversions are timed, STAT.ADC2 is never set; RDATA2 returns status, 000000h, a 00h pad byte and checksum 9Bh; ADC2 calibration commands are nops",
  "conversion data frame fixed at the power-on INTERFACE setting: status byte + 32-bit data + checksum byte (9Bh, the checksum of four 00h data bytes); clearing INTERFACE.STATUS or changing INTERFACE.CRC (off / CRC mode) does not change the frame",
  "conversion times are the first-conversion latencies of Table 9-13 (DELAY = 0, chop off) at fCLK = 7.3728 MHz; later continuous conversions are 1 / data rate; MODE0.DELAY and chop latency (Eq. 19-21) not added; FIR at data rates the FIR filter does not support uses the largest value; the XTAL1/CLKIN pin is not used",
  "conversions restarted by WREG to the ADC-restart registers (MODE0, MODE1, MODE2, INPMUX, IDACMUX, IDACMAG, REFMUX); group-update buffering of block writes",
  "read data direct only valid after DRDY: the model shifts the status/data/checksum frame from every CS fall and repeats it with continued SCLK; data not loaded during an ongoing register read/write",
  "commands blocked while RREG/WREG/RDATA are in progress; RREG past the last register outputs zeros; WREG past it is ignored",
